{"suttaId":"tha-ap155","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[6497,6515],"vripara":"15"},"segments":{"tha-ap155:0.3":"Vīthisammajjakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap155:1.1":"“Udentaṃ sataraṃsiṃva, pītaraṃsiṃva [sitaraṃsiṃva (sī. syā.)] bhāṇumaṃ;","tha-ap155:1.3":"Pannarase yathā candaṃ, niyyantaṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap155:2.1":"“Aṭṭhasaṭṭhisahassāni, sabbe khīṇāsavā ahuṃ;","tha-ap155:2.3":"Parivāriṃsu sambuddhaṃ, dvipadindaṃ narāsabhaṃ.","tha-ap155:3.1":"“Sammajjitvāna taṃ vīthiṃ, niyyante lokanāyake;","tha-ap155:3.3":"Ussāpesiṃ dhajaṃ tattha, vippasannena cetasā.","tha-ap155:4.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ dhajaṃ abhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap155:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, dhajadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap155:5.1":"“Ito catutthake kappe, rājāhosiṃ mahabbalo;","tha-ap155:5.3":"Sabbākārena sampanno, sudhajo iti vissuto.","tha-ap155:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap155:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā vīthisammajjako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap155:8.1":"Vīthisammajjakattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3042,"to":3042,"paras":[{"para":3042,"vripara":"15","refs":["tha-ap155:1"],"lines":["So teneva puññena devamanussesu saṃsaranto ubhayasampattiyo anubhavitvā imasmiṃ buddhuppāde ekasmiṃ kule nibbatto viññutaṃ patvā satthu dhammadesanaṃ sutvā paṭiladdhasaddho bahumānahadayo pabbajitvā laddhūpasampado nacirasseva arahā hutvā attano pubbakammaṃ anussaranto paccakkhato jānitvā pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>udentaṃ sataraṃsiṃ vā</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha udentaṃ uggacchantaṃ sataraṃsiṃ satapabhaṃ.","<b>Sataraṃsī</b>ti desanāsīsamattaṃ, anekasatasahassapabhaṃ sūriyaṃ ivāti attho.","<b>Pītaraṃsiṃva bhāṇuman</b>ti pītaraṃsiṃ saṃkucitapabhaṃ bhāṇumaṃ pabhāvantaṃ candamaṇḍalaṃ iva sambuddhaṃ disvāti attho.","Sesaṃ suviññeyyamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap155:1"],["tha-ap155:1"],["tha-ap155:1"],["tha-ap155:1"],["tha-ap155:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap155:1.1","udentaṃ sataraṃsiṃ vā",0,0],["tha-ap155:1.1","sataraṃsī",0,2],["tha-ap155:1.1","pītaraṃsiṃva bhāṇumaṃ",0,3]]},"tika":null}
